# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every machine (Windows included, whatever core.autocrlf says), so
# editors, gofmt and the .editorconfig agree. Git decides what is text; binaries are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# gofmt only accepts LF.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf

# Windows scripts keep CRLF (cmd.exe needs it).
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
